          "unit_id": "london_plans",
          "title": "A Plan for London",
          "description": "Haz planes para el fin de semana con be going to. Además, planes ya fijados con el present continuous y sugerencias con Shall we…?",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "lesson_id": "london_plans_lesson",
              "title": "be going to",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "A plan for London",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "So, are we going to London next weekend or not?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Yes! I'm going to book the train tickets tonight."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "Where are we going to stay?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "My friend Ciarán has a flat in Camden. We're going to sleep there. It's small, but it's free!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "Perfect. What are we going to do on Saturday?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I'm going to visit the British Museum. I really want to see it."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "And I'm going to take you to a great market in Camden."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "I'm not going to walk all day. My feet always hurt after work!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Don't worry, we're going to use the Tube."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Is Sam going to come?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "No, he isn't. His band is going to play at a wedding."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Then it's the three of us. London, here we come!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "November. Priya has some free days, and Daniel has a friend in London. At lunch in a café near the harbour, they make a plan."
                  }
                },
                {
